{"id":"6ad30e82597031a6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-diagonal-function.md","title":"Diagonal Function $d$","display":"df-diagonal-function — Diagonal Function $d$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-diagonal-function","aliases":["92-df-diagonal-function"],"display":"df-diagonal-function — Diagonal Function $d$","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-substitution-function]]","[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）","source_status":"本地对角函数，非原书字面数函数"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-diagonal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-diagonal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonal-function — Diagonal Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地对角函数，非原书字面数函数"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\">\\(n \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\)</span> (formula code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> (substitution function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"067a36526639087d\" href=\"?note=067a36526639087d\" title=\"92-df-substitution-function\">92-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (definition-target diagonal function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function} \\vdash d:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\qquad d(n)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}(n,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function} \\vdash d:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\qquad d(n)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}(n,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> : 对角化函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\varphi(x) \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\varphi(x) \\urcorner\\)</span> : 公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>的Gödel数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)\\)</span>：将numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span>无捕获地代入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的自由变量<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span></li>\n<li>对角化函数将公式的Gödel数映射到代入该Gödel数后的公式Gödel数</li>\n<li>这是实现自引用的关键函数</li>\n<li>本文件中的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>以合法公式码为定义域；由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d8c59019598b33c\" href=\"?note=5d8c59019598b33c\" title=\"92-fact-sub-recursive\">92-fact-sub-recursive</a>可得到它的全递归延拓。进一步说它在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中可表示，还需要相应的递归函数表示定理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里 d 由一般替换产生且只在公式码上定义。原书 d_E(e)=r_E(e,e) 在所有规范表达式码上全定义，二者数值通常不同；类型和非法输入约定必须保持各自一致。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 25–26（PDF 42–43）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (formula code, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]], [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (formula code, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]], [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"067a36526639087d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sub}$ (substitution function, see [[92-df-substitution-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-sub-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"5d8c59019598b33c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件中的$d$以合法公式码为定义域；由[[92-fact-sub-recursive]]可得到它的全递归延拓。进一步说它在$G$中可表示，还需要相应的递归函数表示定理","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in \\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}function} \\vdash d:\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)\\to\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G),\\qquad d(n)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sub}(n,n)","display":true},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner \\varphi(x) \\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar n,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28281ca315fc78c","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d$ (diagonal function, see [[92-df-diagonal-function]])"},{"id":"659d57dcf656b1a5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$d$ (diagonal function, see [[92-df-diagonal-function]])"},{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depend